---

Note on RAR support: this software contains no RARLAB code. RAR reading is
performed by invoking a separately installed freeware UnRAR backend
(UnRAR.exe / unrar), which remains governed by its own license. RAR archive
*creation* is a proprietary, licensed format and is intentionally not
implemented — this project writes standard ZIP instead.
